"test":{"name":"game-log-replay","kind":"rules","opponent":"Full","rounds":"12","check":"gameLogReplay","question":"Replaying a recorded game: three rounds of the AI against itself are recorded (game.log and a board for every turn), then replayed. The replay has a turn for every board saved, each with its round, its side and what the log says happened in it; it shows each board exactly as it was at the start of that turn, forward and back; nobody plays (every AI off, clicks on the board and the recording ignored); it can be seen as either side sees it (that side's fog) or with everything shown; closing it puts the fog as it was.","rules":"attrition","fog":"on"},
